{"text":"And yet I also learned more about human goodness at Amnesty International than I had ever known before. Amnesty mobilizes thousands of people who have never been tortured or imprisoned for their beliefs to act on behalf of those who have. The power of human empathy leading to collective action saves lives and frees prisoners. Ordinary people whose personal well-being and security are assured join together in huge numbers to save people they do not know and will never meet. My small participation in that process was one of the most humbling and inspiring experiences of my life.","words":[{"text":"And","start":0.0,"end":1.18},{"text":"yet","start":1.18,"end":1.48},{"text":"I","start":1.48,"end":2.62},{"text":"also","start":2.62,"end":2.96},{"text":"learned","start":2.96,"end":3.4},{"text":"more","start":3.4,"end":3.9},{"text":"about","start":3.9,"end":4.24},{"text":"human","start":4.24,"end":4.66},{"text":"goodness","start":4.66,"end":5.18},{"text":"at","start":5.18,"end":5.9},{"text":"Amnesty","start":5.9,"end":6.2},{"text":"International","start":6.2,"end":6.82},{"text":"than","start":6.82,"end":7.62},{"text":"I","start":7.62,"end":7.78},{"text":"had","start":7.78,"end":8.0},{"text":"ever","start":8.0,"end":8.28},{"text":"known","start":8.28,"end":8.48},{"text":"before","start":8.48,"end":9.14,"punct":"."},{"text":"Amnesty","start":10.6,"end":10.96},{"text":"mobilizes","start":10.96,"end":11.82},{"text":"thousands","start":11.82,"end":12.24},{"text":"of","start":12.24,"end":12.58},{"text":"people","start":12.58,"end":12.86},{"text":"who","start":12.86,"end":13.08},{"text":"have","start":13.08,"end":13.18},{"text":"never","start":13.18,"end":13.46},{"text":"been","start":13.46,"end":13.74},{"text":"tortured","start":13.74,"end":14.14},{"text":"or","start":14.14,"end":14.4},{"text":"imprisoned","start":14.4,"end":14.72},{"text":"for","start":14.72,"end":15.02},{"text":"their","start":15.02,"end":15.18},{"text":"beliefs","start":15.18,"end":15.52},{"text":"to"